        "message": "=Hi,\n\nThanks for reaching out. I'm currently out of office until {{ $('Set Configuration Fields').item.json.oooReturnDate }}.\n\nGiven the nature of your message, I've flagged this as urgent and looped in {{ $('Set Configuration Fields').item.json.backupPersonName }} ({{ $('Set Configuration Fields').item.json.backupPersonEmail }}), who will follow up with you shortly.\n\nThanks for your patience,\n{{ $('Set Configuration Fields').item.json.companyName }} Team",
